512 0 obj
  << /ActualText (This archetype exists within systems that are structurally modular but operationally coordinated \024 meaning each part can move semi\055independently\054 but only creates value when timed correctly across the whole\056 These contexts are built for distributed contribution\054 and activities are often fast\055moving\054 multi\055team\054 or cross\055platform\054 such as GTM sequencing\054 real\055time localization\054 or multi\055region DevOps rollouts\056   \n\nThere\031s less emphasis on external regulation \024 the key tension lies in coordination timing and interface integrity\056 A delay or misalignment in one part propagates instantly\054 creating breakdowns across the entire chain\056 \n\nAs such\054 orchestration is not a luxury \024 it\031s a structural necessity\056 These environments prize agility\054 but only when embedded within an infrastructure that can absorb and synchronize change\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 513 0 R
     /Pg 506 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
